# Mobile-First Frontend Implementation Plan (ShopMe)

Bilkul clean, reliable aur zero-confusion architecture ke sath hum Go backend ke liye ek dedicated `frontend/` folder banayenge. 
Har file me **crystal-clear Hinglish/English comments aur hints** rahenge taaki aapko code samajhne aur maintain karne me 1% bhi dikkat na ho.

---

## 1. Tech Stack & Decisions

- **Folder Location**: `c:\Go\shopMe\frontend` (Backend se alag, koi khichdi nahi).
- **Core Tech**: **React + Vite** (Super fast, hot reloading in milliseconds, lightweight).
- **Styling**: **Mobile-First Modern CSS Design System** (Variables, glassmorphism, responsive touch controls, bottom sheets, mobile bottom navigation bar). Koi heavy ya confusing CSS framework setup nahi—sab transparent aur readable classes hongi.
- **Icons**: `lucide-react` (Crisp, clean icons for POS, Inventory, Khata, etc.).
- **Routing**: `react-router-dom` (Clean role-based route separation: Public / Customer / Merchant).
- **API Client**: Standard `axios` with interceptors (JWT token automatically attach hoga, response standard format me extract hoga).

