## 4. Verification Plan

### Automated / Build Verification
- Run `npm run build` in `frontend/` to ensure 0 TypeScript/Babel/JSX compilation errors.
- Check bundle size and clean imports.

### Manual Live Testing
- Start Go backend (`go run cmd/api/main.go` or task).
- Start Vite frontend (`npm run dev`).
- Test login, create shop, test POS sale, test Khata entry, and verify responses match Go backend exactly.
